                            {
                                "example_id": "ec93d0be-42e2-4bc1-81f3-49d18e99a7c1",
                                "sense_id": "e41bd8d9-b6e8-36b9-b605-716444825fcb",
                                "text": "Born poor in rural New Hampshire, Richard and Maurice (Mac) McDonald migrated to California in the late 1920's, equipped with high school diplomas and the desire to make $1 million before they reached 50. […] By 1954, the McDonalds had sold 21 franchises and opened nine outlets."
